will now  start the q a portion of the webinar if  you have a question you'd like to ask  please do so now just click on the ask a  question box located on the far left of  your screen  let's get started  our first question i have here ron what  type of quality assurance do you perform  between platforms  so we purchased the  cap  quality cross check  survey comes out twice a year has three  challenges  and then you can perform it between all  platforms but of course you could  use your own samples just between  different platforms  thank you and then the next one i have  here  what has been the biggest challenge with  testing during the pandemic  i would say without a doubt just  dealing with supplies  making sure that we have enough  of the different reagents to run the  different platforms but  probably more importantly than that even  as all the consumables that go along  with it  been a lot of issue with plastics over  the last year and a half  and of course most of the components for  consumables and the cartridges are  plastic so  simply just trying to keep ahead finding  different vendors to go through  and  really changing the way that i used to  order  so i used to order a case now i may be  ordering 10 20 cases at a  and a little less concern about  expiration dates because we go through  things so quickly  all right thank you so much ron and  thank you again for your time today and  your important research uh before we go  i'd like to thank the audience for  joining us and for their interesting  questions i'd also like to thank our  sponsor luminex for sponsoring today's  webinar questions we did not have time  for today and those submitted during the  on-demand period will be addressed by  the speaker via the contact information  you provided at the time of registration  and this webcast can be viewed on demand  for two years until september 9th of  2023  and labyrinths will alert you via email  when it's available for replay we  encourage you to email 